in your WordPress dashboard, including security and compatibility fixes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Help from GravityKit support</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>New features as we release them</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here is what’s waiting at checkout:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n{{ab_cart_edd_renewal.cart_items_table}}\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If something went wrong at checkout, or you have a question about your renewal, just reply to this email and we’ll help.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All the best,<br>The GravityKit team</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"gk-cart-stop\" style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;\">Don’t want these reminders? <a href=\"##ab_cart_edd_renewal.stop_url##\">Stop these emails</a>.</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n",
